{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2023-06-01 00:01:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL SUSTAINABLE1 APPOINTS CHRIS HEUSLER AS PRESIDENT AND DR. RICHARD MATTISON AS VICE CHAIR', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LONDON , JUNE 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE APPOINTMENT OF DR.\xa0RICHARD MATTISON\xa0TO THE NEWLY CREATED ROLE OF VICE CHAIR OF S&P GLOBAL SUSTAINABLE1 AND THE APPOINTMENT\xa0OF CHRIS HEUSLER \xa0AS PRESIDENT OF S&P GLOBAL SUSTAINABLE1. PRIOR TO THIS APPOINTMENT,\xa0CHRIS HEUSLER HELD THE ROLE OF CHIEF COMMERCIAL OFFICER OF S&P GLOBAL RATINGS AND DR. MATTISON HELD THE ROLE OF PRESIDENT OF S&P GLOBAL SUSTAINABLE1.'}